    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Lords of the Forge",
    "summary": "Your Tech-Priest models get Baffling Data Screed plus two defensive benefits. They have Feel No Pain 5+ and an invulnerable save of 4+. You can use the screed upon picking the priest’s unit to fire. It requires your Shooting phase and a unit free of Battle-shock. The screed uses a D6 and offers two alternative 2+ results. You can give a −1 Battle-shock roll modifier to an enemy Vehicle no farther than 12 inches from the firing unit. A given enemy can receive that selection just once a turn. The other option lets the firing unit retain Hidden despite those ranged attacks.",
